(E) 1D SU(2) exact one-link Haar marginal: log-concave single well  [T]+[V]
    G''(0)=1/(2Cin2pi)=0.205115  Var=3.7198  1/Var=0.268830
    lambda_1(nu)=0.264451  =>  chi <= 1/lambda_1 = 3.781  (measured Var=3.720)
    ess inf G''>0 (single well): plain BE already suffices; higher-order adds nothing.
    beta=2.5 periodic k=0 floor (P2/P4): G''->0.222, Var~4.45 => chi<=4.5.
